 472+ 0566              ; Unified guest memory interface
 473+ 0566              ;
 474+ 0566              ; Guest physical address is classified before selecting its physical backing:
 475+ 0566              ;   00000-9FFFF / C8000-FDFFF : guest RAM, pages 44h-83h
