   1+ 30B2              ; PROJECT126 — virtual 8086 I/O port bus.
   2+ 30B2              ; No physical NeoGS/Z80 port access is performed here. Guest I/O ports are
   3+ 30B2              ; modeled in software; external device requests will be routed through DMA/IPC.
   4+ 30B2              ;
   5+ 30B2              ; Initial deterministic test device:
   6+ 30B2              ;   port 00E0h: 16-bit read/write latch (byte accesses use low lane).
   7+ 30B2              ; Unmapped reads return FFh/FFFFh; unmapped writes are ignored.
   8+ 30B2              ; Guest FLAGS and CPU registers are never changed by the backend.
